      "created_at": "2019-03-19T15:40:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Minty goodness with everyone in the teens except Fanatic cuz yeah. She was around 2 ;)<br>\n<br>\nSuper simple Smackdown really, also won on round 4. Just threw damage on any relic that came out and otherwise used Fanatic to hit herself then hit herself some more once Sacrosanct Martyr came out and was doing something like 10 damage a round to Apsotate. Some un-optimal plays with the environment but eh, it didn't matter.<br>\n<br>\n~Komori</p>",
