    {
      "id": 226017,
      "name": "“Mad Dog”",
      "username": "_Mad_Dog",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/_mad_dog/{size}/4859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-19T22:24:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wow, that was... pretty simple, especially after last week.</p>\n<p>I feel the fight played out something like this:</p>\n<p>Apostate: “Ah, mortals. &nbsp;Tremble in fear before the might of ... “. &lt;WHAP!&gt;<br>\nApostate: &lt;picking himself up and dusting himself off&gt; “Ow.&nbsp; As I was about to say, what do you think of this hoard of demons from the depths of the pit that I have called forth?” &lt;SWISH! POW! THUMP! PUNCH!&gt;. “Okay, you don’t think much of them.”<br>\nApostate: “Foolish mortals, how naive you are to think you can...” &lt;SWISH! POW! BITE! PUNCH!&gt;<br>\nKracken: &lt;CRUSH&gt;<br>\nApostate: “MY SWORD! &nbsp;You stupid calamari! What did you do to my sword?”<br>\nApostate: “Okay! &nbsp;Enough of this! &nbsp;Time to roll up my sleeves and ....” &lt;SWISH! POW-POW! BITEBITEBITE! THUD!&gt;<br>\nApostate: “Mama” &lt;Tips over&gt; &lt;boom&gt;<br>\n&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
