      "raw": "<p>Wow, that was... pretty simple, especially after last week.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I feel the fight played out something like this:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Apostate: “Ah, mortals. &nbsp;Tremble in fear before the might of ... “. &lt;WHAP!&gt;<br />\r\nApostate: &lt;picking himself up and dusting himself off&gt; “Ow.&nbsp; As I was about to say, what do you think of this hoard of demons from the depths of the pit that I have called forth?” &lt;SWISH! POW! THUMP! PUNCH!&gt;. “Okay, you don’t think much of them.”<br />\r\nApostate: “Foolish mortals, how naive you are to think you can...” &lt;SWISH! POW! BITE! PUNCH!&gt;<br />\r\nKracken: &lt;CRUSH&gt;<br />\r\nApostate: “MY SWORD! &nbsp;You stupid calamari! What did you do to my sword?”<br />\r\nApostate: “Okay! &nbsp;Enough of this! &nbsp;Time to roll up my sleeves and ....” &lt;SWISH! POW-POW! BITEBITEBITE! THUD!&gt;<br />\r\nApostate: “Mama” &lt;Tips over&gt; &lt;boom&gt;<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>",
